/** What the Queue reads: Waiting and Active / Outbox (never dismissed items: those are paged from history), and the new conversations not yet accepted, whatever their send state, so nothing on its way out is invisible. `server_id` and `owner_github_id` say whose it is (None when not paired): a snapshot for another pairing is not this one. */
